OL,3,GNEWSAWill Bristol ever get a tram
OL,4,Anetwork?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,7,Fcommitted to "making progress" on a
OL,8,Fmass transit system for Bristol -
OL,9,Fleaning into a decades-long saga that
OL,10,Fhas left the West of England as one of
OL,11,Fthe biggest city regions in the country
OL,12,Fwithout a tram or light rail.
OL,14,F"Mass transit" can include buses, trams
OL,15,Fand trains - the key is the service
OL,16,Fmoves separately to other vehicles,
OL,17,Fpreventing it from getting stuck in
OL,18,Ftraffic.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
