OL,3,GNEWSAWill Bristol ever get a tram
OL,4,Anetwork?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour's West of England Mayor Helen
OL,7,FGodwin has already allocated #150m to
OL,8,Fdevelop a mass transit "vision", with
OL,9,Fthe aim of work starting within five
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FBut government funding to deliver the
OL,13,Fproject has not been guaranteed. A
OL,14,Fsimilar project for a tram system in
OL,15,FLeeds is set to cost #2.1bn.
